  "title": "Sweet Sage Cream Sauce (without the Sage!)",
  "description": "This recipe for sweet sage cream sauce (without sage) includes rosemary, thyme, nutmeg, cinnamon, and brown sugar. Serve it over butternut squash ravioli.",
